\begin{itemize}
  \item LDPC-based cryptographic ingress pipelines (TIG-AC, UW-SIE, BASILS),
  \item Relativistic trajectory propagation engines with multi-body gravitational modeling,
  \item Quantum cosmology integration cores (QCI-Core),
